{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, take it, move to location, inspect object. If battery low, charge it.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTargetLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetLocationReached    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextObject    /> <Condition ID = IsBatteryLow    /> <Action ID = ChargeBattery    />",
